(7493069, 1193564, 6519, '<td valign="top">In ''real life", that must have been an absolutely breathtaking scene, the colours and sun rays are pretty spiffy!! Pity it is so impossible to capture <b>all</b> of the magic in a photograph.<br/> <br/>I''m a bit bothered by the noise (and the big dustbunny blob near the center), and VERY bothered by the crooked horizon, which is such an easy thing to fix, it should never be overlooked.<br/> <br/>A further improvement would have been finding some "subject" for the foreground......  some people, a big rock, a large twisted piece of driftwood.... just something other than water and sky.</td>', 'In ''real life", that must have been an absolutely breathtaking scene, the colours and sun rays are pretty spiffy!! Pity it is so impossible to capture all of the magic in a photograph. I''m a bit bothered by the noise (and the big dustbunny blob near the center), and VERY bothered by the crooked horizon, which is such an easy thing to fix, it should never be overlooked. A further improvement would have been finding some "subject" for the foreground......  some people, a big rock, a large twisted piece of driftwood.... just something other than water and sky.', '2017-01-19 01:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7493133, 1193607, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think some less heavy handed editing could have been beneficial. Especially the foreground, which has way too much contrast.</td>', 'I think some less heavy handed editing could have been beneficial. Especially the foreground, which has way too much contrast.', '2017-01-19 15:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7493134, 1193600, 114225, '<td valign="top">I love the tones.</td>', 'I love the tones.', '2017-01-19 15:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7493619, 1193557, 31167, '<td valign="top">Rule of odds is a hard one to break and get away with and not sold on he idea this is a landscape so it''s a 5. Good luck</td>', 'Rule of odds is a hard one to break and get away with and not sold on he idea this is a landscape so it''s a 5. Good luck', '2017-01-21 23:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
