(7493952, 1193459, 135744, '<td valign="top">What?! You have moved to Northern Ireland - not only that but to the very lovely Antrim Coast. I am sure you have already been to Bushmills. Oh you are spoilt for photo locations in that neck of the woods. I am curious why you have moved to Northern Ireland. I am from Northern Ireland myself but Somerset has adopted me:)</td>', 'What?! You have moved to Northern Ireland - not only that but to the very lovely Antrim Coast. I am sure you have already been to Bushmills. Oh you are spoilt for photo locations in that neck of the woods. I am curious why you have moved to Northern Ireland. I am from Northern Ireland myself but Somerset has adopted me:)', '2017-01-23 08:02:34.000000', NULL, 0),
